{"seq":71,"runId":"brownfield-live","at":"2026-10-29T16:12:21.809491Z","event":{"type":"DecisionRecorded","nodeId":"impl-link-resolver-expiry-fix","title":"Store full Link objects in redirect cache","choice":"Modify CacheConfiguration to configure the redirect cache to store `Link` objects instead of just `String` (target URLs).","rationale":"Storing the full `Link` object, which includes the `expiresAt` field, is necessary for `LinkResolver` to perform the explicit expiration check without needing to hit the database for every cached link. This aligns with the approved design decision to handle expired links robustly with caching.","alternatives":[],"basedOn":["design.doc@v1#8985f7b8e13e","design.openapi@v1#82da79cfa8fb","plan.tasks@v1#0700d5784649"]},"prevHash":"5da831ff4dd5e668aa700c64c748804feb366441c3627b277bb2d7673576792e","hash":"4d89811b0d28b1e0ad108d71fb35d1e276a308d424fb75be22b52545da245ff3"}
{"seq":72,"runId":"brownfield-live","at":"2026-10-29T16:12:21.809590Z","event":{"type":"DecisionRecorded","nodeId":"impl-link-resolver-expiry-fix","title":"Implement explicit expiry check in LinkResolver's resolve method","choice":"In `LinkResolver.resolve(String code)`, after retrieving a `Link` object (either from cache or loaded via `this::load`), explicitly check `link.isExpiredAt(clock.instant())`. If true, throw `LinkExpiredException` and invalidate the entry from the cache.","rationale":"This ensures that even if a link expires while it is already in the cache, subsequent requests for that link will correctly result in a `LinkExpiredException`. Invalidation ensures the expired link is removed from the cache, preventing further hits on an expired entry. This directly addresses FR-3 and NFR-4.","alternatives":[],"basedOn":["design.doc@v1#8985f7b8e13e","design.openapi@v1#82da79cfa8fb","plan.tasks@v1#0700d5784649"]},"prevHash":"4d89811b0d28b1e0ad108d71fb35d1e276a308d424fb75be22b52545da245ff3","hash":"5e2c753d850f79ef5023d659b3cd58e6b6eaedda745fdb340418f7c272743473"}
{"seq":73,"runId":"brownfield-live","at":"2026-10-29T16:12:21.809677Z","event":{"type":"DecisionRecorded","nodeId":"impl-link-resolver-expiry-fix","title":"Implement explicit expiry check in LinkResolver's load method","choice":"In `LinkResolver.load(String code)`, after retrieving the `Link` from the `LinkRepository`, explicitly check `link.isExpiredAt(clock.instant())`. If true, throw `LinkExpiredException` before the link is returned to the cache.","rationale":"This ensures that expired links are never initially loaded into the cache. If a link is already expired when first requested (and thus not in cache), it will immediately throw `LinkExpiredException` without being cached, maintaining consistency with the overall expired link handling strategy.","alternatives":[],"basedOn":["design.doc@v1#8985f7b8e13e","design.openapi@v1#82da79cfa8fb","plan.tasks@v1#0700d5784649"]},"prevHash":"5e2c753d850f79ef5023d659b3cd58e6b6eaedda745fdb340418f7c272743473","hash":"446fa4cb3248d468145bc7edf9d06b17777233590126b0f5c250c0c26c33d296"}
